`common.yaml` holds the options shared by the specifications.

## Adding an experiment

Copy a folder of `experiments/` and change the `id` of its YAML files (each
experiment needs its own). The tests pick up new specifications automatically.

## Outputs

Jobs are identified by their parameters: re-running an experiment only submits
the jobs that are not done. The manager process must stay alive while jobs run:
on a cluster, start it in a `tmux` session.
